<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Research partnership principles">
  <div><strong>Role clarity</strong><span>Scientific advisor, co-author, investigator, institution, contractor and company collaborator are not interchangeable labels.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Verified affiliation</strong><span>Public pages use publisher, university or other authoritative records when describing an external researcher's affiliation.</span></div>
  <div><strong>No borrowed endorsement</strong><span>An individual's university affiliation does not mean the university endorses Best Hydrate or every company claim.</span></div>
</div>

